---
import InfoPage from "../components/InfoPage.astro";
---

<InfoPage title="Frequently asked questions">
  <h2>Can I submit a commission?</h2>
  <p>
    Not yet. This Phase 1 site lets testers create a local summary only; it does not submit,
    store, or send requests.
  </p>
  <h2>Can I upload references or pay?</h2>
  <p>
    No. Private reference uploads and payment processing are planned for later phases after the
    associated privacy, security, and provider requirements are complete.
  </p>
  <h2>Why is the request form asking about eligibility?</h2>
  <p>
    The studio is designing adult-content and prohibited-request safeguards into the experience.
    Final policies will be published before real request intake opens.
  </p>
</InfoPage>
